                "markdown": "A cookie was detected without setting the 'HttpOnly' flag. The 'HttpOnly' flag for cookies instructs the browser to forbid client-side scripts from reading the cookie. Set the 'HttpOnly' flag by calling 'cookie.setHttpOnly(true);'\n\n#### 💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at <a href='https://sg.run/pro'>sg.run/pro</a>\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://semgrep.dev/r/java.lang.security.audit.cookie-missing-httponly.cookie-missing-httponly)\n - [https://owasp.org/Top10/A05_2021-Security_Misconfiguration](https://owasp.org/Top10/A05_2021-Security_Misconfiguration)\n"
              },
